<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks headed higher at the open on Thursday in a follow-through to the previous day's rally which took the Dow Industrials to their first ever close above 6900.</p>
<p>     The Dow Industrials were up eight at 6970 and the   Nasdaq</p>
<p>Composite was up six at 1365.</p>
